 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.4.2-rc2 — OSC live status upgrade
+
+- Added continuous chatbox keep-alive output while OSC is armed.
+- Added current instance population to Chatbox Composer.
+- Added Windows media-session detection with Spotify preference for Now Playing.
+- Added media status/source visibility and manual refresh controls.
+- Updated Music/Normal/Event/AFK presets to include live world/population status where appropriate.
+
 ## 0.4.1-rc1 — Launch polish
 
 - Split the UnderWeb workspace into Command, OSC Lab, People, and System panels.
